description.p:
GameTable is a tabletop platform for one human and up to ten AI models. Use your own
OpenRouter key for cloud seats, or connect a local OpenAI-compatible server such as Ollama;
local seats need no key.

First public build: deterministic referee, Mafia / Werewolf, Buckshot Roulette and Coup;
          OpenRouter and local OpenAI-compatible seats; seat health and preflight tests; replays,
          backups, arena and neural voices.
